- `double sep = MathAbs(ema13 - ema62)` → filter: `sep >= 30*pip_size`
- LONG: ema5 > ema13 && ema13 > ema62 && macd > 0 && sep >= 30*pip
- SL: 30 pips; TP: 50 pips
- P3 sweeps: separation threshold (20/30/40 pips), MACD periods (30,60 vs 12,26), EMA62 vs 55 vs 50

